## Case: legacy-global
id: "av.parity.1122.legacy-global"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1122", "numbers"]
links: ["PLAN-1122"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
use state.first
use state.second
use state.update
fn main() int {
    let x = first()
    let y = second()
    print(x.to_str())
    print(y.to_str())
    print((y - x).to_str())
    update("18446744073709551615")
    let after = first()
    print("wide=" + after.to_str())
    if after != 18446744073709551615u64 { return 1 }
    return 0
}
```

#### state.at

```auto
var x u64 = "5000000000".parse_u64().?(0u64)
var y u64 = "10000000000".parse_u64().?(0u64)
pub fn first() u64 { return x }
pub fn second() u64 { return y }
pub fn update(text str) void {
    x = text.parse_u64().?(0u64)
}
```

