### Notes

Legacy 010 supplies the first three lines. The following mutation writes the maximum through a parameter and reads and formats it across the module boundary.

## Case: signed-i32-and-narrow-control
id: "av.parity.1122.signed-i32-and-narrow-control"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1122", "numbers"]
links: ["PLAN-1122"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
fn main() int {
    if "2147483647".to(int) != 2147483647 { return 1 }
    if "-2147483648".to(int) != -2147483647 - 1 { return 2 }
    let fits = "2147483647".parse_u64().?(0u64)
    if fits.to(i32) != 2147483647 { return 3 }
    let zero = "0".parse_u64().?(1u64)
    if zero.to(i32) != 0 { return 4 }
    return 42
}
```

